     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts CdaCECSCDToCodeConceptMap</b></p><a name=\"CdaCECSCDToCodeConceptMap\"> </a><a name=\"hcCdaCECSCDToCodeConceptMap\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Groupe 1 </b>Mapping de <a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-CE.html\">CE: CodedWithEquivalents (V3 Data Type)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#code\">code</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-CE.html#s-CE.code\">CE.code</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#code#s-code\">code</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td>Le code CDA alimente directement le datatype primitif FHIR code.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Groupe 2 </b>Mapping de <a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-CE.html\">CE: CodedWithEquivalents (V3 Data Type)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#CodeableConcept\">CodeableConcept</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-CE.html#s-CE.originalText\">CE.originalText</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#CodeableConcept#s-CodeableConcept.text\">CodeableConcept.text</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Le texte original CDA alimente directement CodeableConcept.text.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-CE.html#s-CE.code\">CE.code</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">CodeableConcept.coding.code</td><td>Le code principal CDA CE alimente coding.code.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-CE.html#s-CE.codeSystem\">CE.codeSystem</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">CodeableConcept.coding.system</td><td>Le codeSystem CDA est transformé en URI de type urn:oid:[codeSystem] pour alimenter coding.system.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-CE.html#s-CE.displayName\">CE.displayName</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">CodeableConcept.coding.display</td><td>Le libellé CDA displayName alimente coding.display.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-CE.html#s-CE.translation\">CE.translation</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#CodeableConcept#s-CodeableConcept.coding\">CodeableConcept.coding</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td>Chaque translation CDA crée un coding supplémentaire dans le CodeableConcept cible.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Groupe 3 </b>Mapping de <a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-CS.html\">CS: CodedSimpleValue (V3 Data Type)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#code\">code</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-CS.html#s-CS.code\">CS.code</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#code#s-code\">code</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td>Le code CDA CS alimente directement le datatype primitif FHIR code.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Groupe 4 </b>Mapping de <a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-CS.html\">CS: CodedSimpleValue (V3 Data Type)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#CodeableConcept\">CodeableConcept</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-CS.html#s-CS.code\">CS.code</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">CodeableConcept.coding.code</td><td>Par héritage du mapping CE -&gt; CodeableConcept, le code CS alimente coding.code.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Groupe 5 </b>Mapping de <a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-CD.html\">CD: ConceptDescriptor (V3 Data Type)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/data